WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.352
The car went up the track.

2
00:00:07.353 --> 00:00:10.511
"We're driving a car!" said Kip.

3
00:00:10.512 --> 00:00:14.461
"I don't think I like this," said Bird.

4
00:00:14.462 --> 00:00:17.014
The car went higher.

5
00:00:17.015 --> 00:00:22.756
Then Bird smiled.

6
00:00:22.757 --> 00:00:29.522
"Wow! Look at the ocean, Kip," said Bird.

7
00:00:29.523 --> 00:00:32.334
"And look at those buildings!"

8
00:00:32.335 --> 00:00:34.703
But Kip was not looking.

9
00:00:34.704 --> 00:00:36.893
Kip was covering his eyes.

10
00:00:36.894 --> 00:00:47.778
"I don't think I like this," he said.

11
00:00:47.779 --> 00:00:50.490
Now the car went down fast.

12
00:00:50.491 --> 00:00:54.024
"Whee!" said Bird.

13
00:00:54.025 --> 00:00:56.939
"Ah!" cried Kip.

14
00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.529
The car made sharp turns.

15
00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:03.143
It went up and down and up and down.

16
00:01:03.144 --> 00:01:05.279
It went very fast.

17
00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:08.688
"This is fun!" said Bird.

18
00:01:08.689 --> 00:01:16.369
"This is not fun!" cried Kip.

19
00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:20.325
Finally the car stopped.

20
00:01:20.326 --> 00:01:23.491
Kip jumped out.

21
00:01:23.492 --> 00:01:28.503
"That was just like flying!" said Bird.

22
00:01:28.504 --> 00:01:34.312
"I'm glad you had fun, Bird," said Kip.

23
00:01:34.313 --> 00:01:41.032
"But I'm never driving a car again!

24
00:01:41.033 --> 00:02:02.123
Now let's go home and fix your nest."

